When our family started {{ site.name }} back in {{ site.founded }}, the goal was simple: treat every customer's home like our own and charge a fair, honest price for great work. More than fifteen years later, that hasn't changed.

We've grown into one of {{ site.areaServed }}'s most trusted garage door teams — but we're still locally owned, and you'll still talk to a real person who knows your area when you call.

## Why people keep calling us back

- **We show up when we say we will.** Your time matters. We give real appointment windows and keep them.
- **We fix the actual problem.** We won't upsell you a whole new system when a $20 roller will do. Honest diagnosis, every time.
- **We know Florida.** Heat, humidity, salt air, and hurricane season are hard on garage doors. We use corrosion-resistant parts and install wind-rated doors built for our climate.
- **We stand behind our work.** Every repair and installation is backed by our workmanship guarantee.

## Licensed, insured, and local

{{ site.name }} is fully licensed and insured for your protection. We're based right here in {{ site.city }}, and the technician who pulls into your driveway is a trained professional — never a subcontractor we just met.

Whether it's a midnight emergency or a planned upgrade to a beautiful new door, we'd be honored to earn your trust.
